OL,3,GNEWSAKnifepoint burglar says weapon was
OL,4,Ato 'cut onions'
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men have been sentenced for a
OL,7,Fburglary in which they forced their way
OL,8,Finto a man's home and held a knife to
OL,9,Fhis throat.
OL,11,FKyle Smith, 19, and Matthew Williams,
OL,12,F35, broke into the victim's home in
OL,13,FScarborough on 28 August 2025 and stole
OL,14,Fseveral items, including a TV and
OL,15,Fwallet.
OL,17,FWilliams later told police he had
OL,18,Fhelped the victim prepare a Sunday
OL,19,Froast and used the knife "to chop
OL,20,Fonions", in an attempt to explain the
OL,21,Fpresence of his DNA on the weapon when
OL,22,Fit was recovered.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,388,380,200,160,0,100
