OL,3,GNEWSAKnifepoint burglar says weapon was
OL,4,Ato 'cut onions'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt York Crown Court on Thursday, Smith,
OL,7,Fof Blenheim Terrace, Scarborough, was
OL,8,Fhanded a three-year prison sentence,
OL,9,Fsuspended for three years, while
OL,10,FWilliams, of no fixed abode, was jailed
OL,11,Ffor six-and-a-half years.
